Manufacturer and supplier facts

Additional compact component records are independently authored from manufacturer
pin/function and package facts. Their public datasheet and supplier reference
URLs are retained in each catalog record and generated import. They are not
adapted from the source code of unlicensed component repositories.

Land-pattern comparison references: JLCEDA/EasyEDA Official Library.
https://lceda.cn/
https://easyeda.com
The library's copyright and related rights belong to JLCEDA/EasyEDA. Acquired raw
payloads, expanded footprint geometry and remote 3D models are not bundled.
Per-record qualification reports retain reference digests and tool versions.

